### Create a task
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks?userId=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Write README",
  "description": "Add setup instructions",
  "dueDate": "2026-02-01"
}

### List tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks?userId=1

### Get one task
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/1?userId=1

### Update a task
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/1?userId=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Write README",
  "description": "Updated",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
  "dueDate": "2026-02-01"
}

### Delete a task
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/1?userId=1

### Validation test (blank title)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks?userId=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": ""
}